simple-ldapd is a lightweight LDAPv3 directory daemon for SSO via LDAP bind.

It ships an OpenLDAP-style CLI (ldapsearch, ldapadd, ldapmodify, ldapdelete,
ldappasswd), standard schema placeholders, and an AD-compatible attribute
pack. Protocol, TLS, and SASL implementations are still stubs in v0.1.0.

WWW: https://github.com/SimpleDaemons/simple-ldapd
